  WrittenDialogue: "He crashed the car into a tree!\nKidnapper guy, are you still alive?\n...Well that solves that but how do we get out of here? I can’t get untied.\nI hope I’m white and famous enough for the police to go looking for us.\nWhat if this is God getting me back for letting that kid drown?\nChrist maybe I do belong at a satanist swinger party."
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY"
